    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90722" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προφυρ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>knead beforehand</i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μᾶζα προφυρηθεῖσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Vict.</u>
					2.40
				</span></i>
			; also, <i>to be steeped beforehand</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴνῳ, ὕδατι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Od.</u>
				23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προπεφύραται λόγος</span> the speech
				<i>is all ready concocted</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				462
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔστιν κακόν μοι
			προπεφυραμένον</span> there's a mischief <i>ready brewed</i>
			for me, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Th.</u>
				75
			</span></i>.</div>
